dir TB
node Start stadium "開始"
node Input parallelogram "データを入力"
node Process rect "データを検証・処理"
node Condition rhombus "データは有効？"
node Success rect "保存処理"
node Error rect "エラーメッセージ表示"
node End stadium "終了"
link Start -> Input solid none/arrow len=1
link Input -> Process solid none/arrow len=1
link Process -> Condition solid none/arrow len=1
link Condition -> Success solid none/arrow len=1 "Yes"
link Condition -> Error solid none/arrow len=1 "No"
link Success -> End solid none/arrow len=1
link Error -> Input solid none/arrow len=1
